Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.34,0:02:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you wouldn't mind if I\Ntake the pirate hunter's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be my guest.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.87,0:02:25.50,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(729,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2\1a&HFF&\t(687,729,\1a&H00&)}Treasure
Dialogue: 2,0:02:19.87,0:02:25.50,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(729,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, it looks like this dog is frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn, he could\Nsit there forever for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:03:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, please, quit goofing\Naround and get serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.20,0:03:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got me out of a\Npretty sticky situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.02,0:03:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, the key to the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you go steal it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They only did it so we'd be even.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.34,0:03:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid, stupid, stupid dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop picking on poor Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.64,0:04:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who might you be, old man?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.51,0:04:06.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,0)\an2\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)}Boodle\NHarbor Village Mayor
Dialogue: 2,0:04:00.51,0:04:06.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\3c&HE6E6E6&\c&HE6E6E6&\1a&HFF&\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Boodle\NHarbor Village Mayor
Dialogue: 3,0:04:00.51,0:04:06.39,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx85\fscy90\pos(720,630)\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Boodle\NHarbor Village Mayor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, why, I'm the mayor of this town Who\Nare you and why are you hurting Chouchou?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.74,0:04:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told him he really should see a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he insisted that he didn't need to!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and just wanted to sleep it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.92,0:04:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this dog's name is Chouchou?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he just sitting there like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure is a lazy dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's guarding the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.08,0:04:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pet food shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.12,0:04:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the man who used to run this\Nstore was a very close friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he passed, I assume the\Nresponsibility of taking care of Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He died?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.47,0:05:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three months ago, after fighting\Nhis illness for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's been waiting for\Nhis master to return all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That seems to be the consensus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.12,0:05:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I find that very hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chouchou is a smart dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably known for a while\Nthat his master isn't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why does he stay here at the store?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess because he has a connection to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's his treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's guarding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His master left him with this shop,\Nand that's why he protects it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've tried to bring him back to my place\Nso he won't be out in the elements.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he won't take so much\Nas a step away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.03,0:06:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beast Tamer-Moji!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by Beast Tamer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.86,0:06:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, puppy, something's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just give me that key back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see that your friends have deserted\Nyou, and after you just escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm known as the Beast Tamer-Moji,\Na member of the Buggy Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's a weird\Nanimal suit you got on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.06,0:06:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is manly hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's even weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't assume that you're safe\Njust because you're in that cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.74,0:06:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must not know of my terrifying skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no animal in this world that Beast\NTame Emoji can't bend to do his bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:06:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.52,0:07:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does it hurt so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:05.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You nameless thief, I've\Nno interest in killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but tell me where Roronoa Zoro\Nis before I change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ritchie, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm finally out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good boy, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.98,0:07:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's go find Zoro so I can defeat\Nhim and strengthen my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a pet food store.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it quick, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this pathetic little thing\Nreally thinks he can guard the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least now I'm out of that cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First thing, I teach those\Nbuggy pirates a lesson,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I convince Nami to\Nbe the navigator for my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you survive that attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.68,0:08:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got lucky, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.78,0:08:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surviving an attack\Nlike that isn't normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd be scattered all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why exactly did you decide\Nto come to this town?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how'd you get involved\Nwith those pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is searching\Nfor a chart of the Grand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Line and a good navigator\Nto join my pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that guy in the animal suit said\Nhe was looking for Zoro, so I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chouchou, this shop belongs\Nto the two of us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bag is way too big for you, Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.58,0:09:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pat Chouchou, I told you\Nnot to eat the merchandise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's chow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not ready to give up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chouchou, I'm getting on in years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.00,0:09:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta go see the doctor for a checkup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll be back, so guard\Nthe shop until I return.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold down the fort.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has a connection to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's his treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's guarding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.28,0:10:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His master left him with this shop\Nand that's why he protects it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, I can't believe that\Nannoying little dog bit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I thought I killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you still doing alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.86,0:11:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you can't get\Nrid of me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.06,0:11:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time, crush his head\Ninto the ground, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.66,0:11:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be beaten by a lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I ate the Gum-Gum Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:12:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then you have Devil Fruit powers like\NCaptain Buggy, but yours make you rubber?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.17,0:12:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for attacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want any trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for\Nyou to apologize to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.14,0:12:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of you, that dog will\Nnever get his treasure back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, because of that,\NI'm going to kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates are all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all just a bunch\Nof heartless bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They destroy everything that people hold\Ndear without giving it a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.16,0:12:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're alive, pirate! You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:13:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure that lion was going\Nto tear your head off and end it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:04.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wish he had, because then there'd\Nbe one less pirate in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should kill you\Nright now before you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can gather a crew and\Ndestroy everything else!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.36,0:13:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.27,0:13:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.32,0:13:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if you could ever kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe I'll try it and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's all I could say for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard lion ate all the rest of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.86,0:13:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he fought the lion in order\Nto save the dog's food?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fought well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I didn't actually\Nsee you defend the store,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can tell you gave it your all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.48,0:14:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck to you, too, doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were defeated? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.44,0:14:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moji! I can't believe you\Nwere defeated by Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was that Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.58,0:14:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way that skinny little punk\Ncould have gotten the better of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's eating the gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.48,0:14:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.66,0:14:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, prepare all the\Nremaining special buggy balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blow this entire\Nmiserable town to smithereens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:15:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about earlier. I\Ndidn't mean to yell at...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you that's okay you've\Nbeen under a lot of stress
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lately but hey no need\Nto apologize I'm pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.82,0:15:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shu shu and this young one\Nhave fought so hard and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yet I the mayor have\Ndone nothing but sit back
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.98,0:15:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and watch our town be\Nobliterated by buggy and his
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,despicable crew calm\Ndown it's not that bad 40
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.14,0:15:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,years ago this whole area was\Nnothing but Barren, rugged land.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all work together to\Ncreate fields for our crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We opened stores and built\Neverything from the ground up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.02,0:15:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This town is a treasure to\Nme and all its citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From here on out, I refuse to let Buggy\Nand his crew terrorize us anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.18,0:15:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire a special, Buggy Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.24,0:15:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blow this town away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll destroy it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.68,0:16:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro was sleeping in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.56,0:16:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one hell of a way to wake a guy up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have used a few more Zs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you survive that blast?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.34,0:16:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let him get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let this scumbag destroy all of my
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,townspeople worked for\Nthese last 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:37.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the mayor of this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will protect it and its inhabitants.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear to my dying breath. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't defeat Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, but there are some\Nfights that a man can't run from.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.04,0:16:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't egg him on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous for him to fight Back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Back the Clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mayor was crying. He was?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.42,0:17:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the party's\Ngetting more exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time for laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I started to\Ngrow fond of that old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd let him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.12,0:17:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna go too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The injury to my reputation's a lot\Nworse than the injury to my gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.14,0:17:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if we want to get to the grand\Nline, we better go steal that chart back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.94,0:17:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna join our crew or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.74,0:17:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never sink so low\Nas to become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.74,0:17:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I suppose we could team up in\Norder to achieve our common goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:17:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second shot is ready sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then fire
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm mayor Battle in\Nthis town is my treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you terrorize\Nmy people any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come out and fight me you\Nidiot This town is no treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Treasure is gold, silver, and jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cut the crap, old man, and get\Nout of here before I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.30,0:18:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can never understand how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon I'm going to conquer the Grand Line\Nand flashily obtain all the world's riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.62,0:18:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing you can do to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.94,0:18:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the world would belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if this town means so much to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then perhaps I'll do you a\Nfavor and kill you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.38,0:18:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way you won't have to see\Nme destroy your precious village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And fight me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you destroy this\Ntown, if it costs me my very life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Straw Hat's not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to kick your ass, just\Nlike I promised I would, Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.18,0:19:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.72,0:19:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just waltz up to\Nme and treat me like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Captain Buggy and\NI won't stand for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.78,0:19:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, all I want is\Nthe chart and the treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'm out of here, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.36,0:19:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.82,0:19:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're outsiders, leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my fight that I need to\Nbe the one to protect my town.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.02,0:19:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buggy is my fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:19:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you knock out the mayor?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.90,0:20:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the old man had continued\Nto fight, he would have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.36,0:20:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.50,0:20:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I could have thought of a more\Nhumane way to deal with the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the worst thing you\Ncould have said to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you damn flashy idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.82,0:20:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take aim and fire the Buckyball!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.78,0:20:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy, we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.24,0:20:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bum, bum, bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he catch the Buckyball?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could have warned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.72,0:21:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of monster are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you freaked her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that something was weird after\Nyou survived the fight with that lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.38,0:21:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No human being can do what\Nyou do Now explain yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.78,0:21:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what the hell was the balloon\Ninflatey thing that you did just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.24,0:21:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the Gum-Gum balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you call it,\Njust tell me how you did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.60,0:21:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you, some kind of freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.98,0:21:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you try to flashily do me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.36,0:21:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unreal, using his men as a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.30,0:22:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.98,0:22:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world just happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.96,0:22:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.90,0:22:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's that damn Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.94,0:22:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy, we have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.06,0:22:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has Devil Fruit powers too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.66,0:22:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a rubber man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw it myself. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rubber person? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.04,0:22:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.16,0:22:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains how he bounced\Nthat buggy ball back to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.83,0:22:40.55,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an8\bord5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,92)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)}Cabaji "the Acrobat"\NFirst Officer of the Buggy Pirates
Dialogue: 2,0:22:34.83,0:22:40.55,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an8\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,92)\3c&HE6E6E6&\c&HE6E6E6&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Cabaji "the Acrobat"\NFirst Officer of the Buggy Pirates
Dialogue: 3,0:22:34.83,0:22:40.55,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an8\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,92)\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Cabaji "the Acrobat"\NFirst Officer of the Buggy Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.40,0:22:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you plan to respond\Nto this insult, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kappa G.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.70,0:22:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too angry to even fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.52,0:22:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put him down, Kappa G.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.84,0:22:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to my Richie?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.16,0:22:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used it as a shield to keep\Nmy clothes from getting dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.56,0:22:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ritchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:22:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Richie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ritchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ritchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.31,0:23:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about out of my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.12,0:23:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may call me Acrobat Copper Team,\NCaptain Buggy's chief of staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.06,0:23:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will pay for your insolence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll clash swords with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.84,0:23:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an honor, Roronoa Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.90,0:23:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a swordsman myself, I\Nrelish this chance to slay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.12,0:23:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro, you really\Nshould get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.88,0:23:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.04,0:23:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.00,0:23:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the stab wound the captain\Ninflicted on him, the fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.48,0:24:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harsinus, technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.06,0:24:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.94,0:24:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.16,0:24:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't kick you that hard enough, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.88,0:24:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fights dirty, going\Nafter his injury like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.10,0:24:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acrobat technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.24,0:24:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Murder at the steam bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.46,0:24:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acrobat, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.00,0:24:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just an ordinary dust cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.84,0:24:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.60,0:24:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.84,0:24:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's such a disgraceful sight\Nto see a grown man moaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.50,0:24:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose now you can see how foolish it\Nwas to make an enemy of the buggy pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.22,0:24:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's hurt so bad, I don't know how\Nhe's managing to stay in the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.34,0:24:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you just standing\Nthere watching him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.48,0:24:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna get himself killed, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.76,0:25:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro is finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.50,0:25:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You annoying little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.14,0:25:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You having fun poking in my wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.06,0:25:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.36,0:25:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ouchie!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.94,0:25:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you dodge his attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.12,0:25:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that enough of a handicap for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.40,0:25:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now let me show you just how\Nsuperior my skills are to yours
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.42,0:25:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've made a vast error in judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.36,0:25:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be mocked. My swords aim\Nto be the world's greatest. I
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refuse to lose even once to anyone\Nwho calls himself a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.04,0:25:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strong resolve keeps you going.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.66,0:26:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.54,0:26:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wounds as bad as yours will be\Nmore than enough of an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.86,0:26:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For losing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.14,0:26:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To hell with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.14,0:26:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I lose to someone like you,\Neven with these minimal injuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.52,0:26:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I don't have a very bright\Nfuture ahead of me, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.92,0:26:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.04,0:26:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.70,0:26:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stay and watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.56,0:26:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pirates can stand around for the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.66,0:26:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of time and kill each\Nother for all I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.26,0:26:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it doesn't matter to me\Nwhether you guys win or lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.60,0:26:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take this opportunity to swipe\Ntheir treasure and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.30,0:26:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can team up again\Nif we ever get the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.58,0:26:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya, good luck with the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.54,0:26:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks, see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.86,0:26:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a taste of my\Nultimate acrobatic move.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.04,0:27:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acrobatics, the dance of\Na hundred kamikaze times.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.46,0:27:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acrobat technique, a\Nhike in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.36,0:27:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fireworks in the cool summer breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.68,0:27:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's high.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.70,0:27:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sting of the unicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.22,0:27:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ground hugging, chop chop colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.70,0:27:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kamaji, I'll hold Zoro down!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.76,0:27:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you finish him off. Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.66,0:27:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.04,0:27:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.74,0:27:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.82,0:27:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to fight\Nsomeone, how about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.40,0:27:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assure you, I don't need my\Ncaptain's help to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.30,0:28:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.21,0:28:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.90,0:28:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've finally given up, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.98,0:28:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.20,0:28:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm quite impressed that you lasted\Nthat long with such serious injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.16,0:28:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.64,0:28:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of watching your\Nboring little sideshow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.74,0:28:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry to have disappointed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.60,0:28:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about my real swordsmanship?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.50,0:28:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.42,0:28:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.96,0:28:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giri!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.26,0:28:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Comedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.76,0:28:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the Buggy Pirates\Nwere defeated by Betty Thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.22,0:28:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't petty thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.66,0:28:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.30,0:29:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luke, I'm going to sleep. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.72,0:29:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.06,0:29:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.28,0:29:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're searching for the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.00,0:29:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.91,0:29:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not an easy voyage, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.70,0:29:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I don't think that two halfwits\Nthe likes of you can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.08,0:29:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what will you do if by some\Nmiracle you manage to make it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.08,0:29:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on a sightseeing tour or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.60,0:29:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.96,0:29:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.06,0:29:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were king of the pirates,\Nthen that would make me God!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.34,0:29:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.25,0:29:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's only one who can be king of the
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.60,0:29:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pirates and obtain all\Nthis world's treasures,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.76,0:29:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's gonna be me, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.04,0:29:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.20,0:29:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go ahead and settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.64,0:29:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing that Straw Hat\Nbrings back memories of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.34,0:30:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that really gets my blood boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.36,0:30:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bring it on, you wanted a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.64,0:30:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remind me of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.86,0:30:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn cheeky red-haired pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.98,0:30:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.42,0:30:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The red hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.16,0:30:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying you\Nknew my old friend, Shanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.12,0:30:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.16,0:30:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew Shanks once.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.92,0:30:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know where he is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.30,0:30:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.40,0:30:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that depends, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.38,0:30:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I do, and maybe I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.52,0:30:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.10,0:30:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.18,0:30:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't forget, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.40,0:30:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not just going to tell you where\Nhe is out of the kindness of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.34,0:30:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to work for that info.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.80,0:30:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll make you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.90,0:30:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can give it your best shot,\Nbut I don't like your chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.26,0:30:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt Rubber can\Nbounce back from a blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.32,0:30:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.08,0:30:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chop, chop! Ricecracker!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.40,0:31:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't move in mid-air, can you? Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.36,0:31:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.58,0:31:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.08,0:31:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not so bad either, but\Nhere comes Gum-Gum Hissle!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.04,0:31:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their neat abilities, all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.86,0:31:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they leave you wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.16,0:31:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll carve you up! Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.98,0:31:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jump, jump, quick escape! Hissle!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not good enough, Gum-Gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.92,0:31:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you keep breaking into pieces. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.82,0:31:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still going at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.82,0:31:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.20,0:31:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.84,0:31:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.08,0:31:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretend you're still knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.64,0:31:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get yourself caught\Nin the middle of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.00,0:31:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then there's no way you'll\Never make it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.94,0:32:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chop, chop, cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.16,0:32:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Separate.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.00,0:32:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Rutt, you want to give up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.34,0:32:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard! How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.90,0:32:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I not supposed to scratch\Nyour face or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.10,0:32:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.01,0:32:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one damages my lucky hat\Nand walks away from it alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.40,0:32:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This hat is my only treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.44,0:32:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who so much as lays\Na finger on it is going to pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.44,0:32:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I made a solemn promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.86,0:32:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised the guy who\Ngave me this hat that I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.86,0:32:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,form a crew and become\Nthe greatest pirate ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.68,0:32:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I didn't think that there\Nwas anything that could faze him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.22,0:32:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.88,0:32:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's getting so upset about a hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.04,0:33:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it seems that hat has a\Nhistory to it. That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.18,0:33:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really all that special?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.72,0:33:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, you should protect it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.66,0:33:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave this hat to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.60,0:33:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means more to me than anything in the\Nworld, so you better take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.72,0:33:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.96,0:33:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to bring this hat back\Nto me someday, in good condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.82,0:33:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And only once you've\Nbecome a great pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.48,0:33:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our promise, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.70,0:34:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really consider this worthless\Ndirty Straw Hat a treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.52,0:34:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to grow up, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.12,0:34:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.96,0:34:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Shanks gave me\Nthat, I made a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.14,0:34:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.05,0:34:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're telling me that\Nthis used to be Shanks' hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.54,0:34:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder it looked so familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.58,0:34:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He always wore it when I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.86,0:34:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you and Shanks were members\Nof the same pirate crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.04,0:34:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.95,0:34:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we were pirates in\Ntraining, we were fellow comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.62,0:34:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn detestable, red-haired, Aokiji!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.70,0:34:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shanks is a much better\Nman than you'll ever be!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.30,0:34:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have the right to call him comrade,\Nand don't you ever badmouth him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.64,0:34:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for my chop-chop quick escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.22,0:35:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to ever mention\NShakes' name to me again, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.54,0:35:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see whatever the\Nhell I want about Shakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.66,0:35:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what happened between you and\NShakes and where can I find him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.60,0:35:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it how dare you tear\Nup my treasured Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.88,0:35:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to\Nknow he's the one person
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.52,0:35:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I loathe. I'll curse\Nhis name for the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.90,0:35:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of my life, as long as there's\Nbreath in my body, Shanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.70,0:35:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.90,0:36:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That place before someone could beat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.86,0:36:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the promised land was in my grasp
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.06,0:36:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I wouldn't let
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.02,0:36:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go my only dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.00,0:36:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stop chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.14,0:36:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it until it comes true
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.42,0:36:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the world ever changes,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.30,0:36:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call out your name We could return
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.28,0:36:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the time when everything's the same
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.70,0:36:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm with you,\Nmy memories won't fade
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.76,0:36:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for that one true dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.36,0:36:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back.

